<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-498870-1"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-498870-1')">1</a>. It's not like the Foundation values the mental health of their researcher or something&#8230;</div>
